                        FORM OF THE SNAKE
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

|YKB'Never stare into the eyes if evil.'|WK0 - |RKBTeac Arun
|YK0
The legendary creature who caused man to be removed from the
Garden of Eden. Destined to stalk man for eternity as punishment.
A Monk who understands the Snake can not fall victim to one.

This form unlocks several powers which can ONLY be used
while in the form of the Snake.

These powers are: |GKBSeasnake|YK0, |GKBPurge|YK0, |GKBCobra Strike|YK0, 
and |GKBInfuse|YK0.
